q=A.dW(a6,B.m,"Logged by phone: caller cannot get into the gradebook portal on her laptop. Enters her password, the page flashes and comes back to the login screen. Same password works on her phone and for email. First period starts at 8:40 and she has attendance to take.",B.wo,a,!1,B.cu,!0,"8:05 AM",B.m)
